    "Claims come from the description; evidence comes from the diff and CI. There is no score.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Aussagen stammen aus der Beschreibung, Belege aus dem Diff und der CI. Es gibt keine Bewertung."
