    "Enter your passphrase.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Gib deine Passphrase ein."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Every acceptance bullet is mentioned in the pull request's description, changed paths or commit messages.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Jeder Akzeptanzpunkt ist in der Beschreibung, den geänderten Pfaden oder den Commit-Messages des Pull Requests erwähnt."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Every agent Shepherd has seen is on the left, with what became of the work it closed.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Links stehen alle Agenten, die Shepherd gesehen hat — mit dem, was aus ihrer abgeschlossenen Arbeit geworden ist."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Every agent Shepherd has seen, and what became of its pull requests.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Jeder Agent, den Shepherd je gesehen hat, und was aus seinen Pull Requests geworden ist."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Every allowed tool runs unattended, including shell commands.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Jedes erlaubte Werkzeug läuft unbeaufsichtigt, auch Shell-Befehle."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Everything Shepherd has fetched lives in a SQLite file in Application Support. Your token lives in the Keychain and nowhere else.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Alles, was Shepherd geladen hat, liegt in einer SQLite-Datei in „Application Support“. Dein Token liegt im Schlüsselbund und nirgends sonst."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Everything Shepherd syncs for you.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Alles, was Shepherd für dich synchronisiert."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Everything else: a red or running build, a diff over the thresholds, or a workflow, auth, secret, migration or deleted-test file.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Alles andere: ein roter oder laufender Build, ein Diff über den Grenzwerten oder eine Workflow-, Auth-, Secret-, Migrations- oder gelöschte Testdatei."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Explain these lines": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Diese Zeilen erklären"
          }
        }
