    "On-device similarity is %@.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Die On-Device-Ähnlichkeit ist %@."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "One more review was parked in the same run; it comes up next.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ein weiteres Review wurde im selben Lauf geparkt; es kommt als Nächstes."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "One review inbox for everything your agents open.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Eine Review-Inbox für alles, was deine Agenten öffnen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Only %@ changed": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nur %@ geändert"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Only %lld of the %lld words in this bullet appear in the pull request.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nur %lld von %lld Wörtern aus diesem Punkt kommen im Pull Request vor."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Only 1 of the %lld words in this bullet appears in the pull request.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nur 1 von %lld Wörtern aus diesem Punkt kommt im Pull Request vor."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Only local heuristics: file priority, agent detection, risk hints.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nur lokale Heuristiken: Dateipriorität, Agentenerkennung, Risikohinweise."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Open": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Offen"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Open Pull Request": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pull Request öffnen"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Open Settings → Agents": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Einstellungen → Agenten öffnen"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Open Settings → Delegation": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Einstellungen → Delegation öffnen"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Open Settings → Sync, where each one can be retried or discarded": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Einstellungen → Sync öffnen, wo sich jede erneut senden oder verwerfen lässt"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Open Settings → Sync, where the parked reviews are listed": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Einstellungen → Sync öffnen, wo die geparkten Reviews stehen"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Open Shepherd": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Shepherd öffnen"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Open Shepherd Settings": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Shepherd-Einstellungen öffnen"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Open a delegation sheet with this issue as the task. Shepherd creates a worktree on its own branch and runs the assistant you configured; the handover is queued as a comment on the issue.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Öffnet ein Delegationsfenster mit diesem Issue als Aufgabe. Shepherd legt einen Worktree auf einem eigenen Branch an und startet den Assistenten, den du konfiguriert hast; die Übergabe wird als Kommentar am Issue eingereiht."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Open agent pull requests on Conversation": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pull Requests von Agents auf „Conversation“ öffnen"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Open full review": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vollständiges Review öffnen"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Open github.com/login/device": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "github.com/login/device öffnen"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Open is what this section shows unless you ask otherwise. Closed reaches back fourteen days: Shepherd keeps an issue that long after it closes and then prunes it, so anything closed before that is no longer on this Mac and github.com is where to look for it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Offen ist, was dieser Bereich zeigt, solange du nichts anderes wählst. Geschlossen reicht vierzehn Tage zurück: Shepherd behält ein Issue so lange, nachdem es geschlossen wurde, und entfernt es dann – alles, was davor geschlossen wurde, ist nicht mehr auf diesem Mac, und github.com ist die Stelle, an der du danach suchst."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Open on GitHub": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Auf GitHub öffnen"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Open review": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Review öffnen"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Open the check on GitHub": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Den Check auf GitHub öffnen"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Open the full inbox on “Needs my review”": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Die vollständige Inbox auf „Braucht mein Review“ öffnen"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Open the issue on GitHub": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Das Issue auf GitHub öffnen"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Open the review for %@.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Das Review für %@ öffnen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Open the session": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Session öffnen"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Open this line in the diff": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Diese Zeile im Diff öffnen"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Open this review": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dieses Review öffnen"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "OpenAI-compatible": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "OpenAI-kompatibel"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Opened by a bot account": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Von einem Bot-Account geöffnet"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Opened by a person": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Von einem Menschen geöffnet"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Opening your review inbox…": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Deine Review-Inbox wird geöffnet…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Opens the delegation sheet with this finding — you still press Run": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Öffnet das Delegations-Sheet mit diesem Befund — Run drückst du selbst"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Optional. Two-letter country codes, comma-separated. Both fields are sent as part of the request — only endpoints that understand them can act on them, and an endpoint that cannot meet them refuses the request rather than answering from somewhere else. Left empty and off, nothing extra is sent.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Optional. Zweibuchstabige Ländercodes, durch Kommas getrennt. Beide Felder werden als Teil der Anfrage mitgesendet — nur Endpunkte, die sie kennen, können sie umsetzen, und ein Endpunkt, der sie nicht erfüllen kann, lehnt die Anfrage ab, statt sie von anderswo zu beantworten. Leer und ausgeschaltet wird nichts zusätzlich gesendet."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Original, %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Original, %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Overwrite settings": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Einstellungen überschreiben"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Overwrite the field with the draft": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Das Feld mit dem Draft überschreiben"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Overwrite the review summary with the finding": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Die Review-Zusammenfassung mit dem Befund überschreiben"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Overwrite this Mac's settings?": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Die Einstellungen dieses Macs überschreiben?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "PERSONAL ACCESS TOKEN": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "PERSONAL ACCESS TOKEN"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "PROVIDER": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ANBIETER"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Passed to --allowedTools. The default allows reading, editing and git, but no other shell command.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wird an --allowedTools übergeben. Standardmäßig sind Lesen, Bearbeiten und git erlaubt, aber kein anderer Shell-Befehl."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Passphrase": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
